# Hoist @prisma/client (and its generated .prisma/client output) to the
# workspace root so every package that imports it resolves the exact same
# physical module. Without this, pnpm's strict per-package node_modules
# gives each workspace package its own copy, and TypeScript then refuses to
# infer Prisma delegate return types across package boundaries (TS2742).
public-hoist-pattern[]=@prisma/client
public-hoist-pattern[]=.prisma/client
public-hoist-pattern[]=prisma
